		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Grey-skinned, long-bearded old man with a giant snail shell upon his back. Forces avoidant souls to move on.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 25, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 staff +5 (1d4), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Magical Being</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources. Immune to acid and cold.</p><p></p><p><strong>Soul Lock</strong>. 1/day, capture soul of a dead or dying creature. CHA 15+ or soul is trapped in shoki's iron-shod staff.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
